CEN: CENTER,X=1,XP=1,Y=1,YP=1,S=0,DELTA=0,T=0,ONCE_ONLY=0
EM1: EMATRIX,L=0.12,ORDER=1,C1=1e-6,C3=-1e-6,C5=0.12,R11=1,R12=0.12,R22=1,R33=1,R34=0.12,R44=1,R55=1,R66=1
